{
    "title": "ESV Bible",
    "description": "The ESV Bible app allows you to easily read, study, and engage with God\u2019s Word wherever you go, making it the best possible Bible reading experience for your phone or tablet.\r\n\r\nListen to Scripture with audio Bibles and meditate on God\u2019s Word with instrumental background music. Customize your experience with a wide variety of reading plans and thematic playlist options, helping you make daily Bible reading a habit every day.\r\n\r\nREAD THE BIBLE WHEREVER YOU GO\r\n\u2022 Toggle display options to a streamlined, distraction-free reader's mode\r\n\u2022 Search tools allow you to quickly search the Bible by reference, keyword, or phrase\r\n\u2022 Quick access to cross-references\r\n\r\nLISTEN AND MEDITATE\r\n\u2022 Listen to the Bible read aloud by acclaimed Christian artists, pastors, and Bible teachers\r\n\u2022 Voices include Kristyn Getty, Ray Ortlund, Jackie Hill Perry, Michael Reeves, and more\r\n\u2022 Instrumental background music to help you meditate as you listen\r\n\u2022 A diverse selection of musical styles, artists, and genres\r\n\u2022 Individual volume controls allow you to adjust the music and Bible audio separately\r\n\r\nMAKE A HABIT OF BIBLE READING\r\n\u2022 Choose from over 50 Bible reading plans\r\n\u2022 One-year, devotional, and topical plans offer a wide variety of options to fit your lifestyle and reading goals\r\n\r\nDIVE DEEPER INTO GOD\u2019S WORD\r\n\u2022 Access the ESV Global Study Bible for free\r\n\u2022 Subscribe to unlock a full library of study resources, including the ESV Study Bible, ESV Archaeology Study Bible, Preaching the Word commentary series, ESV Expository Commentary series, and more\r\n\r\nENGAGE WITH SCRIPTURE\r\n\u2022 Record your personal reflections using the easy-to-use notes feature\r\n\u2022 Highlight and bookmark favorite portions of Scripture \r\n\u2022 All content saved via a free account is synced with ESV.org\u2014giving you access to personal notes, bookmarks, and highlights from any device\r\n\u2022 Adjust dozens of layout and text settings including font size, red letter, background color, and more\r\n\r\nUNLOCK PREMIUM FEATURES \r\n\u2022 Access to the full range of study Bibles, commentaries, and playlists available online and in the app\r\n\u2022 Over 50 playlists compile thematic verses to guide you through a particular mood, topic, or season\r\n\r\nDeepen your time in God\u2019s Word with customizable study and audio features available with the ESV Bible app. Download for free today!",
    "descriptionHTML": "The ESV Bible app allows you to easily read, study, and engage with God\u2019s Word wherever you go, making it the best possible Bible reading experience for your phone or tablet.<br><br>Listen to Scripture with audio Bibles and meditate on God\u2019s Word with instrumental background music. Customize your experience with a wide variety of reading plans and thematic playlist options, helping you make daily Bible reading a habit every day.<br><br>READ THE BIBLE WHEREVER YOU GO<br>\u2022 Toggle display options to a streamlined, distraction-free reader&#39;s mode<br>\u2022 Search tools allow you to quickly search the Bible by reference, keyword, or phrase<br>\u2022 Quick access to cross-references<br><br>LISTEN AND MEDITATE<br>\u2022 Listen to the Bible read aloud by acclaimed Christian artists, pastors, and Bible teachers<br>\u2022 Voices include Kristyn Getty, Ray Ortlund, Jackie Hill Perry, Michael Reeves, and more<br>\u2022 Instrumental background music to help you meditate as you listen<br>\u2022 A diverse selection of musical styles, artists, and genres<br>\u2022 Individual volume controls allow you to adjust the music and Bible audio separately<br><br>MAKE A HABIT OF BIBLE READING<br>\u2022 Choose from over 50 Bible reading plans<br>\u2022 One-year, devotional, and topical plans offer a wide variety of options to fit your lifestyle and reading goals<br><br>DIVE DEEPER INTO GOD\u2019S WORD<br>\u2022 Access the ESV Global Study Bible for free<br>\u2022 Subscribe to unlock a full library of study resources, including the ESV Study Bible, ESV Archaeology Study Bible, Preaching the Word commentary series, ESV Expository Commentary series, and more<br><br>ENGAGE WITH SCRIPTURE<br>\u2022 Record your personal reflections using the easy-to-use notes feature<br>\u2022 Highlight and bookmark favorite portions of Scripture <br>\u2022 All content saved via a free account is synced with ESV.org\u2014giving you access to personal notes, bookmarks, and highlights from any device<br>\u2022 Adjust dozens of layout and text settings including font size, red letter, background color, and more<br><br>UNLOCK PREMIUM FEATURES <br>\u2022 Access to the full range of study Bibles, commentaries, and playlists available online and in the app<br>\u2022 Over 50 playlists compile thematic verses to guide you through a particular mood, topic, or season<br><br>Deepen your time in God\u2019s Word with customizable study and audio features available with the ESV Bible app. Download for free today!",
